## Install

```sh
helm install my-server oci://ghcr.io/my-org/my-server/charts/my-server --version <x.y.z> -f my-values.yaml
```

Or straight from a checkout of the repository:

```sh
helm install my-server ./helm/my-server -f my-values.yaml
```

